# B = epic stat budget for an item's slot at a player level (m2-affix-loot task 4.2). No character needed.
# 82437 Spelltwister's Grand Robe (chest, robe), 1714 Necklace of Calisea (neck).

# Level 90 -> epic item level 463 (Arpg.Loot.EpicIlvlCurve); a chest has a real budget.
> .arpg loot budget 90 82437
? ilvl=463 slot=0 B=[1-9]\d{2,}

# Level 20 -> ilvl 25; still a budget, much smaller.
> .arpg loot budget 20 82437
? ilvl=25 slot=0 B=[1-9]\d?\b

# A necklace uses another budget column (smaller slot).
> .arpg loot budget 90 1714
? ilvl=463 slot=[1-4] B=[1-9]

# Bad input is refused.
> .arpg loot budget 90 999999999
? error: unknown item

# Native display index (m2 4.1b): fixed-amount "+N stat" enchantments exist for the main stats.
> .arpg loot enchants
? agi n=[1-9]
? sta n=[1-9]
